  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73ff519377b990a4c81cd1461a3c1f62, type: 3}
  m_Name: Rayo_W52_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Rayo
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 375a2426790ffd84aa1a9c7758ba6b06, type: 3}
  dialogueText: 'Kalpasan ti panagpasyar iti intero nga aldaw, kasapulan ti tunggal
    maysa ti tiempo a paginana.


    Iti Ilokano, ti ''maturog'' ket kayatna a saoen
    ti ''sleep.''


    Dayta ti aramid ti panaginana bayat ti turog.


    Denggem
    a naimbag: maturog.


    Ita, padasem nga ibagam ti ''maturog'' iti bukodmo
    a timek.'
  translatedText: 'After exploring all day, everyone needs time to rest.

    In
    Ilokano, ''maturog'' means ''sleep.''

    It is the action of resting while
    asleep.

    Now, try saying ''maturog'' yourself.'
